b.mc("Whose", 2, S, "«Whose bag is this?» — «It's ___.» (it belongs to me)", "mine", ["me", "my", "I"], "Possessive pronoun.", "It's mine.")
b.mc("Reading", 1, S, "Tom wakes up at 7. He has breakfast at 7:30 and goes to school by bus. How does Tom go to school?", "By bus", ["By bike", "On foot", "By car"], "Read the last sentence.", "He goes to school by bus.")
