b.listen("Directions", 2, S, "Listen. Where is the museum?", "Go straight on and turn left at the bank. The museum is on your right.", "On the right after the bank", ["On the left before the bank", "Behind the school", "Next to the park"], "Follow the directions.", "Turn left at the bank; the museum is on your right.")

